{"3930230": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Cat's Wars", "steam_appid": 3930230, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cat's Wars is a turn-based tactics game where cute cats transform into cold-blooded strategists. Choose one of two warring sides and prove who's the true kitty. Control a squad of 5 fighters, combine their unique abilities and lead your furry team to victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930230/extras/2d5407148cb38ed6911ccb8fb442f46e.avif?t=1788246247\" width=780 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At your disposal are Wound Lickers, Bomber Cats, Darkened, Kamicatze and others. Each has its own role and special skills. Experiment with your squad composition to find unexpected tactical solutions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930230/extras/fa0f683d042159b172f563b7491245c3.avif?t=1788246247\" width=780 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use shelters, set ambushes and control the battlefield. The environment is your greatest ally. One wrong move can cost you victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930230/extras/4e605bebdb3c0dad35863614d807bb43.avif?t=1788246247\" width=780 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tokyo</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An urban map for fast-paced battles. Cars, building corners, narrow passages — you can hide and set an ambush everywhere. The short distance making each round tense. For those who enjoy aggressive but thoughtful play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Factory</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An unfinished factory. Because of plenty of open spaces it's perfect for long-range shooting. And unfinished buildings offer opportunities for flanking and ambushes. For those who prefer tactical maneuvers and longer matches.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ready?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choose a side, assemble a squad, and prove that a true cat isn't the one who purrs loudest but the one who plans the best ambush!</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cat's Wars is a turn-based tactics game where cute cats transform into cold-blooded strategists. Choose one of two warring sides and prove who's the true kitty. Control a squad of 5 fighters, combine their unique abilities and lead your furry team to victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930230/extras/2d5407148cb38ed6911ccb8fb442f46e.avif?t=1788246247\" width=780 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At your disposal are Wound Lickers, Bomber Cats, Darkened, Kamicatze and others. Each has its own role and special skills. Experiment with your squad composition to find unexpected tactical solutions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930230/extras/fa0f683d042159b172f563b7491245c3.avif?t=1788246247\" width=780 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use shelters, set ambushes and control the battlefield. The environment is your greatest ally. One wrong move can cost you victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930230/extras/4e605bebdb3c0dad35863614d807bb43.avif?t=1788246247\" width=780 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tokyo</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An urban map for fast-paced battles. Cars, building corners, narrow passages — you can hide and set an ambush everywhere. The short distance making each round tense. For those who enjoy aggressive but thoughtful play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Factory</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An unfinished factory. Because of plenty of open spaces it's perfect for long-range shooting. And unfinished buildings offer opportunities for flanking and ambushes. For those who prefer tactical maneuvers and longer matches.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ready?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choose a side, assemble a squad, and prove that a true cat isn't the one who purrs loudest but the one who plans the best ambush!</strong></p>", "short_description": "Cat's Wars is a turn-based, third-person co-op strategy game. Choose a side: the Catounter or the CaTerror, assemble a squad of 5 unique furry fighters and unleash pure feline chaos. Hide in shelters, set ambushes and destroy your enemies in battle against a friend locally or online.", "supported_languages": "English, Russian, Japanese, Korean, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Simplified Chinese, Portuguese - Brazil", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930230/ad04180cd9e3727733d565db9fca439fe2d6819c/header.jpg?t=1788246247", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930230/1aef36c3950e8738566a06a9cbd911996f6de2ed/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788246247", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930230/1aef36c3950e8738566a06a9cbd911996f6de2ed/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1788246247", "website": "https://antelus-games.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> AMD Ryzen 5 1600／Intel Core i5-6600<br></li>